Package: mojoboost
Type: Package
Title: Gradient Boosting with the mojoboost Engine
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Andrew", "Hendel", email = "ajhendel@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Andrew Hendel [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Andrew Hendel <ajhendel@gmail.com>
Description: R bindings for mojoboost, a gradient boosting decision tree
    library written in Mojo. The package wraps mojoboost's stable C ABI and
    follows the syntax of the 'lightgbm' R package: mb.Dataset(), mb.train(),
    a predict() method, mb.save()/mb.load(), and mb.importance(). Dense
    matrices are supported; sparse input is not yet, because the engine has
    no sparse boosting loop.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
SystemRequirements: mojoboost C ABI >= 3 (build it with capi/build.sh)
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: stats
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
NeedsCompilation: yes
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
